  "body": "Freehold and privately positioned at the end of a quiet Kohimarama cul-de-sac, just a short walk to the golden sands of Kohimarama Beach, cafes and the waterfront beachside dining.\r\n\r\n10 Piccadilly Place brings together family, schooling, flexibility and entertaining - with space to live, work, relax, have fun, raise a family, or enjoy an easy maintenance lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have lived here for 15 years and raised four children in the home. Children moved out and the parents are ready to embrace a new chapter in their lives! \r\n\r\nBuilt in 1965, this beautifully presented Modernist home features soaring raked ceilings, clerestory windows, double glazing, polished timber floors and an abundance of natural light.\r\n\r\nThe home is designed for both family life and entertaining. Upstairs, open-plan living and dining flow to an impressive 15-metre deck, while downstairs opens to a covered BBQ and dining area and a generous, low-maintenance outdoor space with room for a spa, vegetable garden, trampoline or, subject to any required consent, potentially a plunge pool.\r\n\r\nThe separate garden sleep-out adds another level of flexibility, with its own ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, kitchenette and skylight - perfect for teenagers, guests, extended family, working from home, a gym, hobby room or whatever your lifestyle requires.\r\n\r\nTHE HIGHLIGHTS\r\n\r\n> Freehold 531sqm in a quiet Kohimarama cul-de-sac\r\n> In zone for top decile schools - Kohimarama School, Selwyn College and Baradene College\r\n> 15-metre sunny upstairs deck - made for entertaining\r\n> Covered downstairs BBQ and dining area\r\n> Generous, low-maintenance outdoor space with room to make it your own\r\n> Space for a spa, trampoline, vegetable garden or potentially a lap pool, subject to any required consent\r\n> Separate recreational room with bathroom, walk-in wardrobe and skylight\r\n> Four bedrooms at garden level with direct outdoor flow\r\n> Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n> Three bathrooms and two toilets\r\n> Beautiful open fireplace\r\n> Upstairs conservatory / additional room - ideal as an office, gym, yoga room, children's retreat or second lounge\r\n> Open-plan living and dining with raked ceilings and double glazed windows\r\n> Polished timber floors and enduring architectural character\r\n> Heat pumps and whole-house water filtration\r\n> Single garage, carport and additional parking\r\n> Established gardens and tool room\r\n\r\nROOM TO MAKE IT YOUR OWN\r\n\r\nSchool mornings, beach afternoons, summer BBQs, long lunches, teenagers with their own space, working from home or evenings with friends around the fire - this is a home that gives you room to do life your way.\r\n\r\nIt works for a growing family, a busy professional household, teenagers, guests, hobby lovers and entertainers - and can evolve as your needs change.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are ready for their next chapter.  Opportunity like these don't come around often.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself.\r\n\r\n- Conjunctional agents welcome.\r\n- Freehold title\r\n- LIM, Property Files and Sale & Purchase Agreement available on request.\r\n\r\nContact Elena Styles to book a private viewing on 022 175 8050.",
